{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_24\">Problem 24</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 24\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A chemist has m ounces of salt water that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />% salt. How many ounces of salt must he add to make a solution that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/3/c93d829d38f1f73cd97c8fd926e636e968d0c158.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2m$\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\" />% salt?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/b/dbbc466c4819560cf3da704ba303db2c46250cd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{m}{100+m} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{2m}{100-2m}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{m^2}{100-2m}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{m^2}{100+2m}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{2m}{100+2m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"686\" height=\"40\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> oz of salt, and there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da371685ddd797774943c3713b37dd5be7ab1944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\times\\frac{m}{100}=\\frac{m^2}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"41\" /> oz of pure salt. We wish to add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> oz of pure salt so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c72def7d304ff4c5bd0062faf8aac10b0a5a53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{m^2/100+k}{m+k}=\\frac{2m}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"153\" height=\"42\" />. Solving this results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/f/b8f73f37d6ddfc1a4bfba43b7a9b4422a89cae6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=\\frac{m^2}{100-2m}\\rightarrow\\boxed{\\textbf{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"168\" height=\"42\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"